      Entry: 1
      Data: DialogueName3
    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: It was a day like no other, the sun high in the sky, but not a sound
        from the winds. I had traveled for 12 days and 12 nights and I finally reached
        the Island of Revelation. And there he stood, the mightiest dragon I've ever
        seen!
