    - Name: <Name>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: DialogueName18
    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: A powerful storm was on us out of nowhere, blowing our ship way off course
        and further into the dark clouds. Our sky engine was going harder than it
        ever had before, the whole ship creaking and cracking while it swayed side
        to side.
    - Name: <LocalizedKey>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: LOCAL_DIALOG_KEY
