    - Name: <Name>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: DialogueName19
    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: But there it was, hidden in the dark clouds, the remarkable sight of
        a colossal sky serpent! The whole crew knew this was no longer about survival,
        but about glory! We headed straight for the beast, manning the harpoons,
        struggling to hold on.
    - Name: <LocalizedKey>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
