      Entry: 1
      Data: DialogueName20
    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: We were on it in a flash, quick like the lightning around us. The ropes
        of our harpoons shaking in the wind, until I managed to strike a decisive
        blow right through its neck! Har har! What an adventure that was.
