    - Name: <Name>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: DialogueName22
    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: I remember this like it was yesterday, the great boar battle! For days
        and days I traveled through a desert, hopping from sandy island to sandy
        island.
    - Name: <LocalizedKey>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: LOCAL_DIALOG_KEY
    - Name: <Choices>k__BackingField
      Entry: 7
