    - Name: <Name>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: DialogueName23
    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: It took me longer to cross than I planned, and my supplies were runnin'
        low. I knew I needed to find some food, and fast.
    - Name: <LocalizedKey>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: LOCAL_DIALOG_KEY
    - Name: <Choices>k__BackingField
      Entry: 7
