    - Name: <Name>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: DialogueName24
    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: Then there it was, an island oasis. I couldn't believe my eyes. The only
        problem was the great boar that was sleeping there. I was exhausted, hungry,
        and thirsty, but I knew this boar could not stop me.
    - Name: <LocalizedKey>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: LOCAL_DIALOG_KEY
