      Entry: 1
      Data: 57f52fd4-e47b-4fde-a2f4-34ba17c97811
    - Name: <Name>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: DialogueName25
    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: I lept to the oasis, and the boar quickly woke up and got on his feet,
        staring me down. It charged quicker than anything I'd ever seen! I waited
        to the last minute and barely dodged it, and it charged straight into a palm
        tree, with a coconut falling down and knocking it out in an instant.
    - Name: <LocalizedKey>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: LOCAL_DIALOG_KEY
